WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Sign in to the administrator workspace.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
Create Payments API and add two sample services.

00:04.000 --> 00:06.000
Run a successful check, then simulate HTTP 503 and open an incident.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
Restore HTTP 200 and confirm recovery and response-time history.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
Pause, resume and edit monitoring settings.

00:10.000 --> 00:11.500
Review durable outage and recovery notification delivery.

00:11.500 --> 00:12.200
Return to the overview and sign out.
